      "writtenOn": "2018-09-05T18:27:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For openolt the port_no is in the range 0 - 15  The port_id is currently derived from the port_no by \npon_id \u003d 0x2 \u003c\u003c | intf_id.    This is being placed in the context to make it clear.    I have removed the intf_id in the context since the pon_id and intf_id associated with the sourthbound port are the same.   \n\n\"pon_id\": \"536870912\", \"port_no\": \"0\", \"intf_id\": \"536870912\" etc....",
      "parentUuid": "3717fef2_9fe52bd3",
