      "writtenOn": "2018-09-05T18:49:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you adopt the pon_pm_names_from_kpi_extension and just set the value of the pon_id to the OpenOlt port number (0..15) and set the intf_id (physical device port number) to the (0x2 \u003c\u003c pon_id)?\n\nAlso, we could add the additional OpenOLT PON metrics to the general/shared KPI PON metrics.\n\nNone of the PON, ONU, or GEM Port metrics are set in stone, they are just some initial ones that I had access to on the Adtran OLT and thought would be useful for debugging purposes. If the OpenOLT/EdgeCore has a few others that would be useful, I would be fine with including them.\n\nFor all the metrics values, if a specific OLT does not support collection of that value, you just do not implement a property and it will automatically be excluded from the Kafka message.  I thought that was better than reporting \u00270\u0027 or None since that could be misleading.",
      "parentUuid": "d0671f4a_25ca6fcb",
